FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://www.google.com

# Valar Morghulis
House Downing is an IDB-style internet service which provides information
about the popular TV show Game of Thrones.

# Pillars
* Characters
* Events
* Locations
* Organizations
* Episodes

For each pillar there is an associated page to list all elements for that
category, as well as a page for individual elements.


        
## Character Collection [/api/characters]
Fetch all characters.

