## Character [/api/characters/{id}]
Fetch a single character.

+ Parameters
    + id (required, number, `1`) ... Numeric `id` of the Character to perform action with. Has example value.

### Retrieve a character [GET]
Get information corresponding to the character with the supplied {id}.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Header

            X-My-Header: The Value

    + Body
    
            {
                "affiliations": [
                    {
                    "active": false,
                    "char_first_name": "Robert",
                    "char_id": 1,
                    "char_last_name": "Baratheon",
                    "member_id": 1,
                    "org_id": 2,
                    "org_name": "House Baratheon of Kings Landing",
                    "rank": "King"
                    }
                ],
                "alias": "Usurper",
                "birth_loc": null,
                "char_id": 1,
                "death_loc": null,
                "description": "Led a rebellion and became King of the Seven Kingdoms until his untimely death",
                "events": [
                    {
                    "event_id": 4,
                    "name": "The Death of Robert Baratheon"
                    }
                ],
                "first_episode": null,
                "first_name": "Robert",
                "gender": "Male",
                "last_episode": null,
                "last_name": "Baratheon",
                "religion": "Faith of the Seven",
                "status": "Deceased",
                "visited": [
                    {
                    "loc_id": 7,
                    "loc_type": "House Seat",
                    "name": "King's Landing"
                    },
                    {
                    "loc_id": 10,
                    "loc_type": "House Seat",
                    "name": "Winterfell"
                    }
                ]
            }
            
+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Header

            X-My-Header: The Value

    + Body

            {"message":"error", "errors":["not found"]}

